      <h3>Who I help</h3>
      <p>I work with people who are navigating long-term health challenges such as <strong>Lyme Disease, Long Covid, chronic infections, post-viral illness or unexplained chronic symptoms</strong>. Many of my clients have seen multiple professionals, tried different treatments, and still feel unheard or dismissed.</p>
      <p>If you feel like your life has been put on hold because of persistent symptoms, you are not alone. Together, we focus on <strong>progress, not perfection</strong> — step by step, rebuilding your energy, resilience and quality of life.</p>
      <p>Common symptoms I help clients manage through coaching:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Neurological: brain fog, anxiety, hypersensitivity, sleep disturbances</li>
        <li>Cardiac: palpitations, heart rate instability, POTS-like symptoms</li>
        <li>Respiratory: shortness of breath, reduced stamina, air hunger</li>
        <li>Digestive: bloating, abdominal pain, food sensitivities</li>
        <li>Systemic: fatigue, pain flares, post-exertional malaise</li>
      </ul>
      <p><strong>What I do:</strong> I guide you with structure, emotional support and practical strategies to regain function and confidence in daily life.</p>
      <p><em>Important:</em> I do not diagnose or provide medical treatment. Coaching is a complementary support for your healing journey and can be combined with medical care from licensed professionals.</p>
